{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2020-02-18 10:30:00', 'title': 'DUPONT SAYS ED BREEN TO RETURN AS CEO', 'text': 'DUPONT ANNOUNCES LEADERSHIP CHANGES.DUPONT - ED BREEN RETURNS TO CEO ROLE, BECOMING EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER.DUPONT - LORI KOCH NAMED CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER.DUPONT - APPOINTMENTS ARE EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY.DUPONT - MARC DOYLE AND JEANMARIE DESMOND, WHO HAVE SERVED AS CEO AND CFO RESPECTIVELY, WILL DEPART COMPANY.DUPONT - LORI D. KOCH, VICE PRESIDENT OF INVESTOR RELATIONS AND CORPORATE FINANCIAL PLANNING AND ANALYSIS, IS NAMED CFO.DUPONT - NICK FANANDAKIS, FORMER DUPONT CFO, WILL SERVE AS SENIOR ADVISOR TO CEO WITH A FOCUS ON DRIVING RESTRUCTURING EFFORT.DUPONT\'S ED BREEN SAYS "WHILE WE MADE SOME PROGRESS IN 2019, WE DID NOT MEET OUR OWN EXPECTATIONS AND WE NOW NEED TO MOVE AGGRESSIVELY".DUPONT - ED BREEN RETURNS TO CEO ROLE, BECOMING EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER.'}